ERROR #1: Java Not Found
------------------------
Level: CRITICAL
Location: Build system initialization
Message: JAVA_HOME is not set and no 'java' command could be found in PATH

Resolution:
-----------
1. Download JDK 17 from https://adoptium.net/temurin/releases/
2. Install and note installation path (e.g., C:\Program Files\Eclipse Adoptium\jdk-17-hotspot)
3. Set environment variable: JAVA_HOME = [installation path]
4. Add to PATH: %JAVA_HOME%\bin
5. Verify with: java -version

